<title>UK: Birmingham's NEC sets 73 million stg 30-year bond.</title>
<headline>Birmingham's NEC sets 73 million stg 30-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by sole manager UBS Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL EXHIBITION CENTRE (DEVELOPMENT) PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CITY OF BIRMINGHAM COUNCIL</p>
<p> AMT     73 MLN STG   COUPON     7.5625    MATURITY    30.SEP.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.689    PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
